{"t_ms": 16071125, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s4_013", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Presidential Suite Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Presidential Suite is the hotel's premium accommodation, offering a spacious living room, master bedroom, dining area, luxury bathroom, and private balcony. Guests enjoy personalized check-in, complimentary airport transfers, daily breakfast, and priority concierge assistance. The suite is ideal for VIP guests, executives, and families seeking a luxury experience.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Executive Room Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nExecutive Rooms are designed for business and leisure travelers seeking additional comfort. These rooms feature a king-size bed, ergonomic workspace, high-speed Wi-Fi, smart TV, minibar, coffee machine, and city views. Guests staying in Executive Rooms also receive complimentary access to the Executive Lounge during operating hours."], "scores": [0.4653676450252533, 0.6588621139526367, 0.7528064846992493], "filenames": ["13_presidential_suite.txt", "README.md", "12_executive_room.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": -343, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 343, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
